        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jagmeet Singh\n- Organizations: New Democratic Party, Ontario New Democratic Party, Ontario New Democratic Youth\n- Events: 2017 New Democratic Party leadership election\n- Roles: leader, youth wing\n\nFacts:\n- On October 1, 2017, Jagmeet Singh won the 2017 New Democratic Party leadership election with 53.8% of the vote.\n- Jagmeet Singh succeeded the previous leader as leader of the New Democratic Party.\n- Jagmeet Singh Jimmy Dhaliwal was born on January 2, 1979.\n- Jagmeet Singh is a Canadian politician known professionally as Jagmeet Singh.\n- Jagmeet Singh is the leader of the New Democratic Party.\n- The Ontario New Democratic Youth is the youth wing of the Ontario New Democratic Party.\n- The Ontario New Democratic Party is affiliated with the federal New Democratic Party.",
